{'symbol': 'CARR', 'date': '2021-03-18 11:00:00', 'title': 'NORTHERN CALIFORNIA SCHOOL DISTRICT INSTALLS 1,500 CARRIER OPTICLEAN UNITS TO SUPPORT HEALTHIER INDOOR ENVIRONMENTS', 'text': "INDIANAPOLIS, MARCH 18, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TO PREPARE FOR ITS FACILITIES FULLY REOPENING TO STUDENTS AND STAFF, NORTHERN CALIFORNIA'S MANTECA UNIFIED SCHOOL DISTRICT HAS INSTALLED 1,500 CARRIER OPTICLEAN™ DUAL-MODE AIR SCRUBBER & NEGATIVE AIR MACHINES TO PURIFY THE AIR IN CLASSROOMS ACROSS ITS 30 SCHOOLS. THE OPTICLEAN UNITS WILL HELP TO IMPROVE INDOOR AIR QUALITY (IAQ) FOR THE DISTRICT, AS ITS MORE THAN 27,000 STUDENTS, TEACHERS AND STAFF RETURN TO CAMPUSES."}